The hyphenation.en-us npm package (0.2.1, Bram Stein's conversion of the TeX
patterns to the Hyphenator.js / Hypher format) ships without a LICENSE file and
without a license field. The patterns in it are the hyph-en-us patterns, so this
file reproduces the notice from the header of their source, hyph-en-us.tex
(https://github.com/hyphenation/tex-hyphen, hyph-utf8/tex/generic/hyph-utf8/patterns/tex/hyph-en-us.tex,
read 2026-10-09). The exception list in src/text-entry.mjs is the \hyphenation
list at the end of the same file ("DEK's hyphenation exception list, from
hyphen.tex; not changed").

